            // Chapter 2 entrance: the intro skips the battle bus (phase goes straight to safe zones), so there may be
            // no aircraft at all. The bots then drop from the sky next to the player instead of from a bus.
            const bool NoBus=!Aircraft || Aircraft->bActorIsBeingDestroyed;
